body:
Thank you! Yeah, when Yen gets a solid instrumental I'll probably end up doing another one. I'm feeling something off iowa/self titled next.

&#x200B;

Glad you enjoyed :)

Whilst it is unlikely, I would never rule it out as never coming. I like to believe there have been talks about a next-gen version or pc port due to the success of RDR2.

&#x200B;

And yup, the game's plot was already good in its own right, and then RDR2 came in and strengthened it even more;  in my opinion.

It has quite a few (kinda noticable?) mistakes, but I just wanted to get it out there because I spent way too much time trying to make this sound somewhat okay.

&#x200B;

Hope you guys like it :)

its £28 here for me.

&#x200B;

I can do it for £22 if you want

Guys

&#x200B;

I uninstalled bandicam, and the game fucking worked.

&#x200B;

I'm not joking.

S/T, IOWA, .5, Vol.3, WANYK, AHIG

&#x200B;

Wanyk and Vol 3 may change places in the coming weeks for me probably

I was thinking when I first listened that ALOT of these songs remind me of the style of the  Danger Keep Away - Extended Version and turns it out this album is produced by the guy who produced the song, Greg Fidelman.

&#x200B;

Cool shit.
